      "body": "🚀 [CodeProt](https://codeprot.com/) ——Next-generation AI-powered intelligent deep code review tool\n\n<img width=\"1428\" height=\"767\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6537389e-604d-456d-b885-d997769c29dd\" />\n\n**PR Review**\n\n<img width=\"1210\" height=\"1110\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fc1bc84e-94eb-4b32-81d9-c6c5c33f9bba\" />\n\n**Code Suggestion**\n<img width=\"1182\" height=\"555\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6fae8ef-12fc-479d-be2b-42236db48a61\" />\n\nFaster, more accurate, and better at understanding code context.\n\nIn an era of rapid, iterative development, manual code review often becomes a bottleneck to efficiency. CodeProt's goal is clear: to make code review faster, smarter, and more reliable.\n\n🌟 Why choose CodeProt?\n1. Truly \"context-aware\" intelligent censorship\n\nUnlike traditional Lint tools, CodeProt uses advanced NLP and ML technologies to understand the true intent of code.\n\nIdentify security vulnerabilities and performance risks\n\nCapture high-risk issues such as missed boundary conditions and inconsistent states\n\nAvoid pointless prompts and maintain focus\n\n2. Seamlessly integrate into your development workflow\n\nSupports GitHub / GitLab / Self-hosted GitLab\n\nAutomatically generates accurate and actionable review reports for every Pull Request.\n\nNo black box, no code modification—you retain control of all decisions.\n\n3. Improve team efficiency and maintain individual quality\n\nLarge teams: Reduce missed checks, accelerate review cycles, and free senior developers from repetitive checks.\n\nSmall teams & independent developers: A readily available \"second pair of eyes,\" providing professional-level review support.\n\n✨ Make code review no longer a burden\n\nWhether you are building a large system or starting a new project,\n\nCodeProt is the best partner for improving code quality, efficiency, and security.",
