      "body": "简单说，这是一个非常有意思的网站。\n功能很简单：上传任意照片，AI 帮你秒速换脸生成表情包。效果出奇好，而且：\n  - 第一张图免费\n  - 不用下载 APP，手机、电脑上就能直接打开网页使用\n  - 不用注册账号\n  - 10秒就能出结果（人多可能需要排队）\n\n  还有个\"Custom\"模式可以自定义互换脸、图片背景，私下想怎么玩就怎么玩。\n\n  网址：[kirkify.live](https://kirkify.live/)\n\n\nTransform any photo with AI-powered face swapping. Create hilarious memes in seconds.\n\n  Features:\n  - Instant generation (~10 seconds)\n  - No sign-up required for first use\n  - Works on any device (mobile & desktop)\n  - Custom face swap mode\n  - High-quality output\n\n  Try it: [kirkify.live](https://kirkify.live/)\n\n  Tech Stack: Next.js 16, React 19, Tailwind CSS, Prisma, Stripe, NextAuth",
